# Google workspace — MCP only

For **Google Docs** and **Gmail** in this project:

- Use the deployed MCP server (`scripts/publish_doc.py`, `scripts/publish_draft.py`) or Cursor agent with `prompts/mcp_publish_docs.md` / `prompts/mcp_publish_gmail.md`.
- **Do not** add `googleapis`, `google-auth`, or hand-rolled OAuth/REST clients for Docs/Gmail in this repository.
- Run `scripts/check_pii.py` before any publish step.
- Gmail: create **drafts** only — never auto-send.

MCP server: https://github.com/dheerajmw/MCP-server
